== Effects ==
* Drops 1-20 full {{E|Red Heart}}s on the ground.

== Notes ==
* Red Hearts spawned by this card are not affected by most replacement effects, other than those of {{r|Super Secret Room}}s.

== Strategy ==
* Any extra hearts left over could be used for a {{Machine|Blood Donation Machine}} to get extra money.
* The same can also be used for {{Machine|Devil Beggar}}s, {{Machine|Hell Game}}s, and {{Machine|Confessional}}s.
* Any characters that are unable to have red hearts can benefit from this card if they have {{i|Dark Bum}}, as it can drop {{E|Black Heart}}s.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Maggy's Bow}}: With the increased healing, Isaac could get up to 40 hearts.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}}: No effect.

